[
{
"k": "31218",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; sad]Nobody would control us, or use us... we were going to be in charge for once."
},
{
"k": "31219",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "We started this place together. So nobody would control us, or use us... we were going to be in charge for once. That was the point."
},
{
"k": "31220",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]We're all liars, aren't we?"
},
{
"k": "31221",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[accusing; angry]But that was all bullshit, right?"
},
{
"k": "31222",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[defensive]It didn't start that way! [beat] If I could take it back..."
},
{
"k": "31223",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It's my life!"
},
{
"k": "31224",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You're not gonna take that away from me."
},
{
"k": "31225",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[slight anger; frustration]I'm sick of everyone thinking they can just-- [searches for the words] do what they want with my life."
},
{
"k": "31226",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I thought it would be different here."
},
{
"k": "31227",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "But it's all the fucking same."
},
{
"k": "31228",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in shock]No no no no no!"
},
{
"k": "31229",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[horrified]Vivian…"
},
{
"k": "31230",
"who": "IN GENERAL I FEEL LIKE SOME OF THE DIALOG IDLES ARE OCCASIONALLY A LITTLE *TOO INTERESTING*",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": ") .  They should be natural and interesting, yeah, but basically background-y.  A lot of players can't make a choice and listen to the idle at the same time.  We don't want to pull their attention in two different directions.\n\nAnd, idles should never ever move the story ball forward.  Cool important stuff belongs in the mainline.\n\nAll IMHO, feel free to disagree!"
},
{
"k": "31231",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Jesus."
},
{
"k": "31232",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You couldn't stop her?"
},
{
"k": "31233",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I have to arrest you."
},
{
"k": "31234",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]You think I'm the one to fuckin' blame?"
},
{
"k": "31235",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[stern]Georgie... [calm down]"
},
{
"k": "31236",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I'm not going to stop you."
},
{
"k": "31237",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Get UP!"
},
{
"k": "31238",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "...both of you."
},
{
"k": "31239",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "{AngryC}You expect me to believe that?"
},
{
"k": "31240",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Georgie, listen to me."
},
{
"k": "31241",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[rage]You're not my fucking mother! So keep your goddamn fuckin' nose out of it!"
},
{
"k": "31242",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[rage]I told you to shut the hell up!"
},
{
"k": "31243",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[shock]Just-- [beat] Jesus..."
},
{
"k": "31244",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[cold]It's for the best. Now Nerissa and the others can be free."
},
{
"k": "31245",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[numb]The fuck is wrong with you?"
},
{
"k": "31246",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[frustrated]Dammit!"
},
{
"k": "31247",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Why would she want to be involved in this?"
},
{
"k": "31248",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Said she'd rather die on her own terms. For somethin' good... or at least somethin' close to it."
},
{
"k": "31249",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I know I made a mistake... killin' those girls."
},
{
"k": "31250",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]I know you think it's my fault."
},
{
"k": "31251",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[sympathetic]You couldn't stop her?"
},
{
"k": "31252",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; angry]But I-- [coughing] I did what I had to!"
},
{
"k": "31253",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; angry] That I killed 'em for some twisted pleasure of mine."
},
{
"k": "31254",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[defeated; angry]And then it comes back to bite you in the ass because some good-for-nothin'-- [cough]Crooked bastard decides you're not worth shit anymore! [groans in pain]"
},
{
"k": "31255",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; anry]You don't always get a choice!"
},
{
"k": "31256",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; angry]This is just bullshit!"
},
{
"k": "31257",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; angry] Some of the girls decided to pull a runner on us."
},
{
"k": "31258",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; angry] Crooked Man told me to \"take care of it\". What do you think that means? Huh!"
},
{
"k": "31259",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "None of this would've happened if it wasn't for that bastard!"
},
{
"k": "31260",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Piece of shit."
},
{
"k": "31261",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "All of it!"
},
{
"k": "31262",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It's his fuckin' fault!"
},
{
"k": "31263",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[sharp pain]Ah!"
},
{
"k": "31264",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Come on! We can't stay here."
},
{
"k": "31265",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]Hang on. I need a minute."
},
{
"k": "31266",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[worried]Okay..."
},
{
"k": "31267",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[freaking out]And now the Sheriff is chasing us through the streets!"
},
{
"k": "31268",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "We come here to escape, but all we find is even more shit."
},
{
"k": "31269",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "What were we supposed to do?"
},
{
"k": "31270",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]I wish you were right."
},
{
"k": "31271",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "There had to be a way..."
},
{
"k": "31272",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[dying]Sure it's not."
},
{
"k": "31273",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Crooked Man'll be there? You're sure?"
},
{
"k": "31274",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Crooked Man made me do it!"
},
{
"k": "31275",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[hurt]I trusted you."
},
{
"k": "31276",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You have to understand... nobody was supposed to die."
},
{
"k": "31277",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "People like us could come here, and be taken care of. They'd have a home."
},
{
"k": "31278",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "That was the point."
},
{
"k": "31279",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[accusing]But then you put those ribbons around their necks and wouldn't let them leave."
},
{
"k": "31280",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "But you don't have a choice. Not really."
},
{
"k": "31281",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "They'll be slaves... forever."
},
{
"k": "31282",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "But if you spare her..."
},
{
"k": "31283",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Don't I get a say?"
},
{
"k": "31284",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[seething anger]Please."
},
{
"k": "31285",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Not if you're involved."
},
{
"k": "31286",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Of course you do."
},
{
"k": "31287",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Not if you're involved in this."
},
{
"k": "31288",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You're right.  Of course you do."
},
{
"k": "31289",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "What is it then?"
},
{
"k": "31290",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; regret]I know what I've done."
},
{
"k": "31291",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It's too late."
},
{
"k": "31292",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It's the only way."
},
{
"k": "31293",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I said I'm not doing it."
},
{
"k": "31294",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Vivian, this is the way it has to be."
},
{
"k": "31295",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; regret]I know that."
},
{
"k": "31296",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "But you're not going to be the one to do it."
},
{
"k": "31297",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Vivian, I'm not going to kill you."
},
{
"k": "31298",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I have to-"
},
{
"k": "31299",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "It was my ribbon... and if those girls are ever going to be free... I have to-"
},
{
"k": "31300",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[wait]Vivian..."
},
{
"k": "31301",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I'm not innocent here. I know that."
},
{
"k": "31302",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[quiet] Goodbye, Georgie."
},
{
"k": "31303",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[stern; don't do this]Vivian. I didn't mean--"
},
{
"k": "31304",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[holding in angry tears]I couldn't save Faith and Lily... but if I can do something... if I can make it right for the rest of those girls..."
},
{
"k": "31305",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Vivian!"
},
{
"k": "31306",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I didn't fuckin' mean it."
},
{
"k": "31307",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[breathing through pain]"
},
{
"k": "31308",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[horror]No!"
},
{
"k": "31309",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "But I'm gonna be the one to make it right."
},
{
"k": "31310",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "But I have to make it right."
},
{
"k": "31311",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[to herself]I can't believe this."
},
{
"k": "31312",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Don't..."
},
{
"k": "31313",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Don't you dare fucking do this."
},
{
"k": "31314",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "For both of us."
},
{
"k": "31315",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry, sarcastic. continuing] Couldn't take it off, couldn't talk about it."
},
{
"k": "31316",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I was just--"
},
{
"k": "31317",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]We used her's to make the rest."
},
{
"k": "31318",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain]Couldn't take it off, couldn't talk about it."
},
{
"k": "31319",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in a lot of pain; angry]Crooked Man gave the order!  He told me to kill those girls! And then he fuckin' sold me out! [cough]"
},
{
"k": "31320",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You don't want to... right?"
},
{
"k": "31321",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[what's going on] Wait..."
},
{
"k": "31322",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[rage]You think you're just gonna come in here, take me away, and it's all gonna be fuckin' solved!?"
},
{
"k": "31323",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[rage]That you can just blame me for all this shit!"
},
{
"k": "31324",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Go ahead! Pull it."
},
{
"k": "31325",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]What the fuck are you supposed to do then?"
},
{
"k": "31326",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "He could kill you!"
},
{
"k": "31327",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Don't make me hurt you."
},
{
"k": "31328",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[threatening]If you don't get out of the way right now, I'll have to--"
},
{
"k": "31329",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]You think I don't know what that means? Either I do what he says or I'm the one getting \"dealt with\"!"
},
{
"k": "31330",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; in pain]Either I do what he says or I'm the one getting \"dealt with\"!"
},
{
"k": "31331",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You know I didn't have a goddamn choice! What the fuck? [grunts in pain]Guh."
},
{
"k": "31332",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "I didn't mean--"
},
{
"k": "31333",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "The both of you can go rot in Hell."
},
{
"k": "31334",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "Georgie, just stop. We messed up-"
},
{
"k": "31335",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[betrayed; angry]You're gonna throw me to the fucking wolf too!"
},
{
"k": "31336",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]Oh, so now it's \"we\" is it?"
},
{
"k": "31337",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "All that magic is connected to this little thing."
},
{
"k": "31338",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[bitter]So did I..."
},
{
"k": "31339",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "You gotta pay just like I do."
},
{
"k": "31340",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[snapping]Well, so did I!"
},
{
"k": "31341",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[determined]I'm sure as hell gonna do it."
},
{
"k": "31342",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[barely holding it together]This isn't what I wanted."
},
{
"k": "31343",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[firm]No."
},
{
"k": "31344",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[barely holding it together]But I won't be a villain either."
},
{
"k": "31345",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "She felt responsible for Faith and Lily... [coughs] what her ribbons did to them."
},
{
"k": "31346",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "But I won't be a monster either."
},
{
"k": "31347",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry]But it's all the fucking same."
},
{
"k": "31348",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[angry; painful breathing]Either I do what he says or I'm the one getting \"dealt with\". I had to do it!"
},
{
"k": "31349",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
"en": "[in pain; angry]And Crooked Man didn't want to get his fuckin' hands dirty... so he told me to \"take care of it\"!"
},
{
"k": "31350",
"who": "PORGIE",
"ctx": "Fables105/env_puddingnpie",
